# Cloudflare Pages security headers
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Notes (2026-05-19):
# - HSTS: 6-month max-age, NO preload, NO includeSubDomains yet.
#   Per Sally's review: preload is hard to roll back (browser-baked list),
#   and includeSubDomains can break any *.michaelreflects.com subdomain
#   that isn't HTTPS-only. Revisit both after 6+ months of stable HSTS.
# - X-Frame-Options: DENY (no one needs to embed this in a frame).
# - Permissions-Policy: deny features the site never uses, including the
#   privacy-hostile FLoC interest-cohort.
# - CSP (JOURNAL-CSP-01 Phase 2a, 2026-11-22): sent as
#   Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only, so browsers report violations and block
#   nothing. The value below must equal csp/phase2.policy exactly; the Pages build
#   (tools/pages-build.sh, CSP_PHASE=2a-report-only) fails if it doesn't. Edit both
#   together. Why each host is allowed: docs/csp/phase2a-report-only.md.
#   Phase 2b switches the same policy to enforcing Content-Security-Policy.
#   Pages Functions (reply pages, weather.json, deleted posts) are not covered by
#   this file and keep their own headers.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15552000
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://tinylytics.app https://townsquare.michaelreflects.com https://bubbles.town https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://townsquare.michaelreflects.com; img-src 'self' data: https://media.mitchelltribe.xyz https://img.youtube.com https://www.themoviedb.org https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog https://i.snap.as https://mitchelltribe.com https://scribbles.page https://cdn.bsky.app https://coverartarchive.org https://*.archive.org https://tinylytics.app https://mitchelltribe.social https://mitchelltribe.rodeo https://cdn.masto.host https://image.nostr.build https://avatars.webmention.io; media-src 'self' https://media.mitchelltribe.xyz; frame-src https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://mitchelltribe.tube; connect-src 'self' https://tinylytics.app https://townsquare.michaelreflects.com wss://townsquare.michaelreflects.com https://api.listenbrainz.org https://coverartarchive.org https://bubbles.town; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
